cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "lunar-comms-survey: Open-Source Toolchain for Lunar Wireless Communications"
abstract: >
  A living survey and Python toolchain for lunar wireless communications research.
  Covers surface RF propagation with lunar terrain and regolith physics, 3GPP/5G
  stack adaptation for the Moon, and Delay-Tolerant Networking for the Solar System
  Internet. Validated against LOLA/PGDA DEMs, Siegler 2020 regolith maps, and
  LCRNS Reference Constellation 3.1 ephemerides.
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2025-06-01"
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/ebaenamar/lunar-comms-survey"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ebaenamar/lunar-comms-survey"
keywords:
  - lunar communications
  - 5G NTN
  - lunar propagation
  - regolith dielectric
  - ELFO
  - DTN
  - LunaNet
  - Artemis
authors:
